WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.969
Welcome to Nam Illam. Choose Create a new home if you are starting fresh. If your

00:05.969 --> 00:11.194
family invited you, join that existing home instead of creating a duplicate.

00:15.400 --> 00:21.069
Enter a home name such as Our Home. This is a label inside the app, not your street

00:21.069 --> 00:24.825
address or a login account. Then choose Create my home.

00:30.400 --> 00:36.100
Your new home starts empty. Open Pantry to record what you have, Shopping for what

00:36.100 --> 00:41.522
you need, or Expenses to record a purchase. The setup activities are optional.

00:45.400 --> 00:51.172
Use Today for your schedule and reminders. Your household works locally without an

00:51.172 --> 00:56.592
app account. Family sharing and iCloud are optional, and can be set up later.
